      "html": "<ul><li>Scientific name: Pseudecheneis sulcata (McClelland, 1842)</li><li>Common name: Brahmaputra Suckerthroat</li><li>Type locality: Khasi Hills, Meghalaya, India</li><li>Sexing: not known</li><li>IUCN Red List: Least Concern (last assessed 2009)</li></ul>"
